IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0017.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FEE0017C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 EXCESS-FEE         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "EXCESS-FEE=" EXCESS-FEE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    IF TXN-COUNT-MTH > 10
        COMPUTE EXCESS-FEE ROUNDED = (TXN-COUNT-MTH - 10) * 0.50
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'B' AND TXN-COUNT-MTH GREATER THAN 30
        ADD 25 TO EXCESS-FEE
    END-IF.
